abstract: >-
  A Harbor-native focused-task suite for studying how coding-agent harnesses
  interact with software workspaces under controlled task and model conditions.
  Version 0.1.0 contains five Batchline focused tasks and a 15-cell canonical
  result matrix across OpenCode, Mini-SWE-Agent, and one private custom-harness
  snapshot.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - agent harnesses
  - software engineering
  - evaluation
  - Harbor
